    "created_at": "2016-03-18T08:21:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-18T08:21:21Z",
    "body": "Can it be renamed to just \"settings object\"? I wished it was shorter to read and write.\n\nCurrently it says \"a script has a settings object and a settings object is an environment settings object that specifies those algorithms.\" Can we make it to \"a script has a settings object that specifies those algorithms\", and just use the shorter reference handle?\n",
