    "created_at": "2016-03-18T16:43:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-18T16:43:48Z",
    "body": "> Can it be renamed to just \"settings object\"? I wished it was shorter to read and write.\n\nI think that would be a bit too confusing since \"settings object\" is fairly generic. If we're going to take on the cost of renaming I think we'd gain a lot by changing \"environment\" to \"realm\". Then every time you see it you're reminded of the 1:1 correspondence with realms (and thus, hopefully, with globals).\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
